From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WavJaby <WavJaby@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 20:52:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Build the GL proxy libraries for x86_64 guests

The identity engine runs x86_64 guests on an x86_64 host, so the
NativeBridge guest needs x86_64 builds of the GL and window proxies.
Their stub lists are LP64 and arch-neutral (stubs_arm64.cc equals
stubs_riscv64.cc), so the x86_64 build takes the arm64 list.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Patch-Reason: the x86_64 arch blocks live inside these Android.bp modules, which no launcher, loader or environment setting can add; the stub list is shared by every LP64 arch here
---
SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
 android_api/libEGL/Android.bp          | 3 +++
 android_api/libGLESv1_CM/Android.bp    | 3 +++
 android_api/libGLESv2/Android.bp       | 3 +++
 android_api/libGLESv3/Android.bp       | 3 +++
 android_api/libnativewindow/Android.bp | 3 +++
 5 files changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/android_api/libEGL/Android.bp b/android_api/libEGL/Android.bp
index 39b8a4042ae0f27a8809a3d59a0a803ca1f811d8..919b28995edab1fecbb175e71540834968463f78 100644
--- a/android_api/libEGL/Android.bp
+++ b/android_api/libEGL/Android.bp
@@ -30,6 +30,9 @@ cc_library {
         arm64: {
             srcs: ["stubs_arm64.cc"],
         },
+        x86_64: {
+            srcs: ["stubs_arm64.cc"],
+        },
         riscv64: {
             srcs: ["stubs_riscv64.cc"],
         },
